OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGBOMB EXPLODES IN
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGWEST BELFAST
OL,5, There has been an explosion in west
OL,6, Belfast in the Newbarnsley area where
OL,7, a joint army/RUC base is situated.
OL,9,FPolice say they do not yet know if
OL,10,Fthere are any casualties.
OL,11,F
OL,12,FThere are no further details at present
OL,13,F
OL,15,F
OL,17,F
OL,18,F
OL,19,F
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG10-04-90
