OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGSTRANGEWAYS SIEGE
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGCONTINUES
OL,4,F
OL,5, Another inmate at Strangeways prison
OL,6, has surrendered, bringing to three the
OL,7, number who have surrendered today.
OL,9,FThe Home Office says there are now
OL,10,Ffewer than 20 inmates still inside the
OL,11,Fjail on the tenth day of the siege.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Home Secretary David
OL,14,FWaddington has extended the terms of
OL,15,Freference for the Strangeways inquiry.
OL,17,FLord Justice Woolf, who will lead the
OL,18,Finquiry into the riot, said he will
OL,19,Fexamine disturbances at other jails
OL,20,Fto consider any possible links.
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG10-04-90
OL,23,D]F Much more at: teletextarchive.com
